        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Request One Course",
            "id": 152245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We’ve used query parameters to filter which data an API returns.</p><p>Route parameters are another option. They also add values to a URL, but they help us target a specific resource directly.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url_with_query_parameters = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url_with_route_parameters = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read a Route Pattern",
            "id": 152246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A route pattern like <code>/courses/1</code> includes the resource ID directly in the URL path.</p><p>Complete the code to add the route parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"route_pattern = \" /><text value=\"&quot;/courses/1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Route Value",
            "id": 152247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The route value follows the resource name and a slash.</p><p>Add <code>/12</code> to request the course with ID <code>12</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?id=12\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Send the Course Request",
            "id": 152248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Once we’ve constructed the URL, including the route parameter, we can use it to make the API request.</p><p>Pass the finished URL to <code>requests.get()</code> to send the request.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>12</code>, and finally <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Once we’ve constructed the URL, including the route parameter, we can use it to make the API request.</p><p>Fetch course ID <code>12</code> using a route parameter and pass the finished <code>url</code> to the request.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?id=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>12</code>, <code>get</code>, and finally <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 152264,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use the <code>certificate_id</code> variable as the route parameter to request a specific certificate.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"certificate_id = \" /><text value=\"37631\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/certificates/\" /><text value=\"{certificate_id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 37631,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;learner_id&quot;: 14689122\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;completed&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code>, followed by <code>certificate_id</code>, and finally <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 152265,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Where is a route parameter added in a URL?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">In the URL path</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In the requests import</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">In the response data</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">In the URL path.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You change a request from <code>/courses?id=12</code> to <code>/courses/12</code>. Where is the ID now passed?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">In the URL path</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In the requests import</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">In the response data</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">In the query string after <code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick In the URL path.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
