            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use the <code>things</code> endpoint to request item ID <code>1</code> with a route parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things/1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"courses\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>things</code>, followed by <code>/</code>, and finally <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
